    "blurb": "AI-orchestrated retail inventory management",
    "overview": "Automate retail inventory with AI-driven demand forecasting, stock optimization, and perishable goods tracking, orchestrated by Camunda processes.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Intelligent Inventory Orchestration With AI-Driven Forecasting and Automation",
    "splashDescription": "Retail inventory management is complex and error-prone. Stockouts cost retailers an estimated $1 trillion annually in lost sales. Overstock ties up capital and increases waste, especially for perishable goods. Manual analysis is slow, inconsistent, and cannot scale across thousands of SKUs. Siloed systems (POS, ERP, warehouse) make real-time decision-making difficult. The AI-Powered Retail Inventory Agent combines Camunda process orchestration with generative AI and an event-driven architecture to address these challenges and automate end-to-end retail inventory management. It aggregates real-time inventory data from POS and ERP systems, then uses that data with LLMs to forecast demand (including configurable confidence scoring). It can detect stock issues, route decisions that trigger procurement or overstock alerts, notify teams with actionable recommendations, and optimize perishable goods with dynamic pricing. It includes robust dashboards and reporting options to drive continuous improvement.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/778695/overview/img15431268669828425941.png?b0e91d799682b05f5af3148d1bccaf6c",
